# Neutral-to-Claude vocabulary, applied in order before claude.overrides. A span
# these substitutions cannot reach is recorded there as an anchored override.
your question tool	AskUserQuestion
\(shell\)	(Bash)
one shell call	one Bash call
writing sub-agents on the PLAN tier's model \(conventions §11\.6, where the harness can name one\)	`Agent` subagents (`subagent_type: general-purpose`, `model:` the PLAN tier value, omitted when empty)
writing sub-agents on the EXEC tier's model \(conventions §11\.6, where the harness can name one\)	`Agent` subagents (`subagent_type: general-purpose`, `model:` the EXEC tier value, omitted when empty)
